==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|de|bescheissen||Switzerland}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|beschīzen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|biskīzan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*biskītaną}}, equivalent to {{af|de|be-|scheißen}}. Cognate with {{cog|nds-de|beschieten}}, {{cog|nl|beschijten}}, {{cog|en|beshite}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/bəˈʃaɪ̯sn̩/|/bəˈʃaɪ̯sən/}}
* {{audio|de|De-bescheißen.ogg|Audio}}
* {{hyph|de|be|schei|ßen}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|bescheißen<beschiss,beschissen>}}

# {{lb|de|colloquial|vulgar|transitive}} to [[rip off]], to [[screw]]

